  "content_html": "<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p data-end=\"196\" data-start=\"0\">Fill your life with sparkle and make your skin look even better with <strong data-end=\"98\" data-start=\"69\">«Golden Glow» Bath Pearls</strong>.<br data-end=\"102\" data-start=\"99\"/>\r\nEnriched with natural oils and edible glitter, they leave your skin glowing like never before!</p>\n<p data-end=\"387\" data-start=\"198\"><strong data-end=\"213\" data-start=\"198\">Bath pearls</strong> are ultra-moisturizing beads for your skin that not only provide instant hydration but also make bath time more enjoyable while filling the room with a delightful fragrance.</p>\n<p data-end=\"556\" data-start=\"389\">Baths with bath pearls help soften and moisturize the skin, relax muscles and the nervous system, and improve the skin’s overall condition by enhancing its elasticity.</p>\n<p data-end=\"571\" data-start=\"558\"><strong data-end=\"571\" data-start=\"558\">Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-end=\"655\" data-start=\"573\"><strong data-end=\"600\" data-start=\"573\">Glitter-infused formula</strong> adds a radiant glow and a subtle shimmer to your skin.</li>\n<li data-end=\"893\" data-start=\"657\"><strong data-end=\"679\" data-start=\"657\">Delicate fragrance</strong> leaves a long-lasting scent trail on the skin. <strong data-end=\"743\" data-start=\"729\">Top notes:</strong> bergamot, tea. <strong data-end=\"777\" data-start=\"761\">Heart notes:</strong> floral accord, freesia, sambac jasmine, orchid, rose, osmanthus. <strong data-end=\"860\" data-start=\"845\">Base notes:</strong> amber, patchouli, vanilla, musk.</li>\n<li data-end=\"966\" data-start=\"895\"><strong data-end=\"911\" data-start=\"895\">Natural oils</strong> provide additional care and nourishment for your body.</li>\n<li data-end=\"1282\" data-start=\"968\"><strong data-end=\"983\" data-start=\"968\">Shea butter</strong> deeply moisturizes and nourishes the skin. Rich in unsaturated fatty acids, vitamins, and antioxidants, it helps restore the skin, protect it from UV-induced damage, support natural regeneration processes, reduce flaking, prevent dryness, soften the skin, improve elasticity, and soothe irritation.</li>\n<li data-end=\"1399\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"1284\"><strong data-end=\"1299\" data-start=\"1284\">Baking soda</strong> helps soften and cleanse the skin while gently removing dead skin cells without causing irritation.</li>\n</ul>\n </div>\n</div>",
